    {
      "subId": "39811",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Otto",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3981101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3981101": {
            "id": "3981101",
            "speakerId": 1162,
            "speakerName": "Otto",
            "text": "Thanks for helping us clean up the battlefield... You really didn't have to, you know...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3981102"
            ]
          },
          "3981102": {
            "id": "3981102",
            "speakerId": 1162,
            "speakerName": "Otto",
            "text": "This work ethic of yours really puts me to shame.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3981103"
            ]
          },
          "3981103": {
            "id": "3981103",
            "speakerId": 1162,
            "speakerName": "Otto",
            "text": "I know this paltry sum doesn't begin to pay you back for everything you've done for the Knights, but... for what it's worth, please take it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "39801",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Amber",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3980101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3980101": {
            "id": "3980101",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "You guys are back! The Honorary Knight returns triumphant!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980102"
            ]
          },
          "3980102": {
            "id": "3980102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Yup, {NICKNAME}'s back from tussling with Dvalin!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980103"
            ]
          },
          "3980103": {
            "id": "3980103",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "You just returned yesterday, right? Jean got back first, and she told us all about your heroic deeds.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980104"
            ]
          },
          "3980104": {
            "id": "3980104",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "*sigh* I wonder if I'll ever get an opportunity like that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980106",
              "3980109"
            ]
          },
          "3980106": {
            "id": "3980106",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "That doesn't come into it. You guys deserve all the credit for how you resolved this crisis.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980107"
            ]
          },
          "3980107": {
            "id": "3980107",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "When I brought you into the city that day, I was just doing my duty as an Outrider.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980111"
            ]
          },
          "3980111": {
            "id": "3980111",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You're welcome! ...But, have you been waiting for us here this whole time?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980112"
            ]
          },
          "3980112": {
            "id": "3980112",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Of course not! Just because I'm not out on the front line doesn't mean I don't have work to do... In fact, I'm dealing with the aftermath of the crisis as we speak.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980113"
            ]
          },
          "3980113": {
            "id": "3980113",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Aftermath? Here? What happened in Mondstadt?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980114"
            ]
          },
          "3980114": {
            "id": "3980114",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "While Master Jean was away, the monsters lurking nearby made a coordinated attack on the city.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980115"
            ]
          },
          "3980115": {
            "id": "3980115",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Fortunately, we weren't completely taken by surprise. I detected the hilichurls were moving closer to the city a while back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980116"
            ]
          },
          "3980116": {
            "id": "3980116",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh yeah! Paimon remembers. When we first met, you were clearing out one of their camps...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980117"
            ]
          },
          "3980117": {
            "id": "3980117",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Exactly. And if we hadn't started making preparations back then, Mondstadt would be in much greater danger by now."
          },
          "3980109": {
            "id": "3980109",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "You're right, actually. Peace is hard-won, and we shouldn't take it for granted.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980110"
            ]
          },
          "3980110": {
            "id": "3980110",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "And this time, you're the one we should all be grateful to."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "39802",
      "subQuestName": "Chat with the locals (Cyrus)",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3980401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3980401": {
            "id": "3980401",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "Here we go! This is it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980402"
            ]
          },
          "3980402": {
            "id": "3980402",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "Crisis! Danger! The thrill of adventure!!!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980403"
            ]
          },
          "3980403": {
            "id": "3980403",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "Adventurers' Guild! Finally, our days of rescuing kittens and finding lost puppies are over! The age of adventure is upon us!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980404"
            ]
          },
          "3980404": {
            "id": "3980404",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "Roll up, youngsters, join the Adventurers' Guild today! In this time of great upheaval, we must rally together, take on the dragon, and save our great city of Mondstadt!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980405"
            ]
          },
          "3980405": {
            "id": "3980405",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yeah, about that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980406"
            ]
          },
          "3980406": {
            "id": "3980406",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "...What!? WHAT!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980407"
            ]
          },
          "3980407": {
            "id": "3980407",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "The Stormterror threat is resolved? I missed the Acting Grand Master's speech?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980408"
            ]
          },
          "3980408": {
            "id": "3980408",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980409"
            ]
          },
          "3980409": {
            "id": "3980409",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "...Bah! Stormterror should have put up more of a fight! We didn't get to join in..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "39803",
      "subQuestName": "Chat with the locals (Nimrod)",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3980301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3980301": {
            "id": "3980301",
            "speakerId": 1461,
            "speakerName": "Nimrod",
            "text": "Long live the heroes! Thank you, it's finally over.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980302"
            ]
          },
          "3980302": {
            "id": "3980302",
            "speakerId": 1461,
            "speakerName": "Nimrod",
            "text": "Many trade routes have closed due to the Stormterror incident. We can cope for now without fresh fruit and vegetables... But if the wine supply dries up, we're all doomed!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980303"
            ]
          },
          "3980303": {
            "id": "3980303",
            "speakerId": 1461,
            "speakerName": "Nimrod",
            "text": "I cannot imagine a world without wine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980304"
            ]
          },
          "3980304": {
            "id": "3980304",
            "speakerId": 1461,
            "speakerName": "Nimrod",
            "text": "I hope they get the trade routes back up and running soon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "39804",
      "subQuestName": "Chat with the locals (Grace)",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3980201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3980201": {
            "id": "3980201",
            "speakerId": 1429,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "So, Stormterror's true identity is Dvalin — one of the Four Winds! We never should've forgotten his past sacrifice for Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980202"
            ]
          },
          "3980202": {
            "id": "3980202",
            "speakerId": 1429,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "Every cloud has a silver lining — we're fortunate that our relationship with the Dragon of the East didn't sour past the point of no return.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980203"
            ]
          },
          "3980203": {
            "id": "3980203",
            "speakerId": 1429,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "For that, we have you to thank. And Jean, for her unfailing devotion.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980204"
            ]
          },
          "3980204": {
            "id": "3980204",
            "speakerId": 1429,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "As long as we have the Knights of Favonius, peace and freedom will prevail in Mondstadt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "39807",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Good Hunter",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3980701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3980701": {
            "id": "3980701",
            "speakerId": 1419,
            "speakerName": "Sara",
            "text": "Greetings, may I take your order?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980702"
            ]
          },
          "3980702": {
            "id": "3980702",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Why so cold? I've always thought that we enjoy quite the intimate friendship.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980704",
              "3980706"
            ]
          },
          "3980704": {
            "id": "3980704",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Hahaha... It seems your great battle sharpened not only your combat skills but your wit as well. A knight after my own heart.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980707"
            ]
          },
          "3980707": {
            "id": "3980707",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "To bask in the presence of Mondstadt's new big hero is quite the morale boost. And that's coming from a knight.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980708"
            ]
          },
          "3980708": {
            "id": "3980708",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sweet-talking sugar-coated Captain Kaeya...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980709"
            ]
          },
          "3980709": {
            "id": "3980709",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Haha, nonsense! I speak from the heart."
          },
          "3980706": {
            "id": "3980706",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Ah, so you do feel something for me. And people say my charm is fake."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "39808",
      "subQuestName": "Take a seat by Amber",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "39809",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Amber",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3980901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3980901": {
            "id": "3980901",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "So. Now the Stormterror threat is behind us, what are your plans for the next step?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980902"
            ]
          },
          "3980902": {
            "id": "3980902",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Paimon thinks it's time to leave Mondstadt, and keep looking through the seven nations until we find clues about {F#her brother}{M#his sister}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980903"
            ]
          },
          "3980903": {
            "id": "3980903",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Huh, really? Oh... Well, I guess this is goodbye for now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3980906"
            ]
          },
          "3980906": {
            "id": "3980906",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Hey, don't feel down! You'll always be a friend of the Knights of Favonius and our Honorary Knight. Wherever you may go, and wherever the wind may blow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "39820",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3982001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3982001": {
            "id": "3982001",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "*sigh* What timing... Not only was Jean away right when the hilichurls attacked, but Kaeya had disappeared, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3982002"
            ]
          },
          "3982002": {
            "id": "3982002",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Luckily, the knights on hand all did an admirable job and we successfully defended the city.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3982003"
            ]
          },
          "3982003": {
            "id": "3982003",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "I guess Kaeya must have had his reasons.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3982004"
            ]
          },
          "3982004": {
            "id": "3982004",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "I mean, it's not like he would've just sat the whole thing out at the Cat's Tail, right? ...Right?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "39821",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3982101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3982101": {
            "id": "3982101",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "I salute you, Honorary Knight.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3982102"
            ]
          },
          "3982102": {
            "id": "3982102",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "The Acting Grand Master gave a public address on the Stormterror incident. It was truly inspiring.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3982103"
            ]
          },
          "3982103": {
            "id": "3982103",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "The truth was... incredible. And to think the Knights nearly approved a plan to slay the dragon... We were too quick to jump to conclusions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3982104"
            ]
          },
          "3982104": {
            "id": "3982104",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Still, it could take a long time for those who suffered to forgive Dvalin. And who knows whether they can forgive him fully...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3982105"
            ]
          },
          "3982105": {
            "id": "3982105",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "As ever, we must let the wind lead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "39822",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3982201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3982201": {
            "id": "3982201",
            "speakerId": 1441,
            "speakerName": "Guy",
            "text": "We're lucky Albedo stayed in the city during the crisis. Our defenses were all the stronger for it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3982202"
            ]
          },
          "3982202": {
            "id": "3982202",
            "speakerId": 1441,
            "speakerName": "Guy",
            "text": "It was a rare privilege to see the Chief Alchemist of the Knights of Favonius in action.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3982203"
            ]
          },
          "3982203": {
            "id": "3982203",
            "speakerId": 1441,
            "speakerName": "Guy",
            "text": "Makes me wonder whether I should try my hand at alchemy too..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}